    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a pretty strong take on UBI. Why do you think the \"disincentive to work\" argument is more valid than the argument that a floor of economic security actually empowers people to take risks or pursue education? It seems like you're dismissing the stability benefits of UBI pretty quickly.",
